BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 453.30 Td (NOT B: Chemoreceptor stimulation, rather than suppression, promotes respiration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 47 439.70 Td (NOT D: Excess oxygen is not the initiating problem in shock.) Tj ET
